        alt="The AZ Tech Services team at the front desk of the Ashburn shop"
        width="1320"
        height="990"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption>Our team at the front desk</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/images/techs-motherboard.jpg"
        alt="Technicians inspecting a laptop motherboard at AZ Tech Services in Ashburn, VA"
        width="1320"
        height="990"
